   "he": "קָמַץ וְעָלָה בְּיָדוֹ צְרוֹר, אוֹ גַרְגֵּר מֶלַח,",
   "en": "§ The mishna teaches: If a priest «removed the handful» of flour, «and a stone or a grain of salt emerged in his hand,»"
  },
  {
