   "daf": "11a",
   "sentenceId": 0,
   "he": "אוֹ קוֹרֶט לְבוֹנָה – פָּסוּל. כֹּל הָנֵי לְמָה לִי?",
   "en": "«or a pinch of frankincense» emerged in his hand, the meal offering is «unfit,» as the handful lacks a full measure on account of these items. The Gemara asks: «Why do I» need «all these» examples? Any one of them would convey the fact that the handful must contain a full measure."
  }
